<section class="nosotros-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <h1 class="nosotros-hero__title">Our History</h1>
        <p class="nosotros-hero__text">A dream that was born to transform education through art.</p>
        
    </div>
</section>
<section class="historia">
  <div class="container historia__wrapper">
    <div class="historia__main-grid">
      <div class="historia__content">
        <p>
          CAPI was born in 2021 from a shared dream: to create a place where children and youth in Samaipata could discover their talents through art. 
          Founded by 
        <a href="#fundadoras" id="fundadora-liliana"><strong>Liliana Navía</strong></a> and 
        <a href="#fundadoras" id="fundadora-monica"><strong>Mónica Navía</strong></a>, 
        our center is more than a school: it is a creative sanctuary where each student finds their voice.
        </p>
        <p>
          As a non-profit organization, every resource is invested directly in our students and programs. What started as a project of two sisters passionate 
          about education is now a seedbed of talents where art and pedagogy merge to transform lives.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="historia__image">
        <img src="/assets/img/quienes_somos.webp" alt="CAPI Founders" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="historia__filosofia">
      <p>
        We live in a world where young people spend more and more time in front of screens and less time connected with their community. At CAPI, 
        we believe that art is the perfect bridge to reconnect: between parents and children, between teachers and students, between dreams and reality.
      </p>

      <p>
        We don't just teach artistic techniques or school subjects. We accompany each child and young person in discovering who they are, what passionates 
        them, and how they can contribute to the world. Because we believe that every student is a potential talent that deserves a safe environment to 
        project their future with confidence.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

