<div id="modal-liliana" class="modal" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="modal-liliana-title" aria-modal="true">
  <div class="modal__content">
    <button class="modal__close" onclick="closeModal('modal-liliana')" aria-label="Close Liliana Navía modal">&times;</button>
    
    <div class="modal__header">
      <h3 id="modal-liliana-title">Liliana Angélica Navía Torrejón</h3>
      <p class="tag">General Director, Co-founder & Coach</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="modal__body">
      <h4>Her Passion</h4>
      <p>
        Liliana has dedicated her life to working with children and young people, especially those in vulnerable situations. 
        Her experience ranges from work with street children to creating alternative educational spaces where art becomes a tool for transformation.
      </p>
      
      <p>
        As a family and personal development coach, she firmly believes that every child has a unique talent waiting to be discovered.
      </p>

      <h4>Education</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Bachelor's Degree in Psychopedagogy</strong>
          <p>Universidad Católica Boliviana "San Pablo" (Santa Cruz, Bolivia)</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Master's Degree in Project Cycle Management and Humanitarian Action</strong>
          <p>Universitat Oberta de Catalunya UOC (Barcelona, Spain)</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Master in Mayeutik Coaching and Self-Knowledge</strong>
          <p>Kuestiona (Madrid, Spain)</p>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h4>Her Role at CAPI</h4>
      <p>
        Since 2021, Liliana leads the general direction of CAPI with a clear vision: to create a space where art and education meet to transform lives. 
        She designs artistic and pedagogical programs, coordinates the professional team, and manages cultural activities that connect CAPI with the broader 
        Samaipata community.
      </p>
      
      <p class="modal__quote">
        "We believe each young person has a talent in the making that deserves a safe environment to project their future with confidence."
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<div id="modal-monica" class="modal" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="modal-monica-title" aria-modal="true">
