      </p>
      
      <p>
        Graduated with honors, she combines her psychopedagogical training with a continuous search for educational innovation to offer students at CAPI 
        the best learning tools.
      </p>

      <h4>Education</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Bachelor's Degree in Psychopedagogy</strong>
          <p>Universidad Católica Boliviana "San Pablo" (Graduated with honors).</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Diploma in Innovation and Creativity for Education</strong>
          <p>University of Salamanca Foundation (Spain).</p>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h4>Her Role at CAPI</h4>
      <p>
        Since 2021, Mónica has led the Pedagogy department with an integral approach. She organizes educational activities, designs personalized learning 
        strategies, and manages the centre's communication so that every family feels part of the CAPI community.
      </p>
      
      <p class="modal__quote">
        "Each student is unique. Our work is to find the best way to support them on their path of learning and growth."
      </p>
